# The fixed test of scripts/laurel/ios26-autotest.sh. Docs: docs/laurel_sprout/ios26-autotest.md. Coordinates in panel pixels, 720x1560.
#   step NAME                     a new row of the table
#   lock                          power key, only if the panel is on: panel off and locked
#   wake                          power key, only if the panel is off
#   key power|volup|voldown|home [MS]    tap X Y [MS]    swipe X0 Y0 X1 Y1 [MS]    edge bottom|top|left|right [LEN] [MS] [AT]
#   open BUNDLE_ID                home   (an edge swipe from the bottom: the home key of this model does nothing)
#   wait SECONDS                  shot TAG
#   settle QUIET_MS MAX_MS [change]   waits until the picture holds still; change: it must first change, else the step fails. At about 9 fps a fixed wait shows a frame of the animation
#   record N MAX_MS               starts a sequence shot, in the background, for the next gesture
#   stop                          waits for it, then finds frames that equal an older frame, and black frames
#   changed                       this step fails if the last two shots show the same picture
# Keep these steps as they are: their numbers compare between builds. Other tests go in another file (--scenario).

step unlock
lock
wake
settle 700 8000
shot locked
record 60 4000
edge bottom 800 300
stop
settle 1000 8000
shot unlocked
changed

step home-swipe
home
settle 1000 8000
shot page1
record 60 4000
swipe 620 800 100 800 300
stop
settle 1000 8000
shot page2
changed
swipe 100 800 620 800 300
settle 1000 8000
shot page1-again
changed

step control-center
shot before
record 120 8000
edge top 700 300 650
stop
# Control Center takes seconds to come at first, and its modules come after the blur has held still [V phone]
settle 3000 20000
shot open
changed
record 60 4000
edge bottom 700 300
stop
settle 1500 15000
shot closed
changed

step settings-scroll
open com.apple.Preferences
settle 2000 30000 change
# Settings comes back where it was left: to the top of the list first, or the swipe has nowhere to go
swipe 360 300 360 1400 150
settle 1000 10000
swipe 360 300 360 1400 150
settle 1000 10000
shot open
record 120 6000
swipe 360 1300 360 300 300
stop
settle 1000 10000
shot scrolled
changed
home
settle 1500 15000 change
shot home
changed
